# Outputs split (per SoccerNet email, 2026-06-01):
#   - Annotation-derived + aggregate parquets are open source and committed.
#   - Video-derived parquets inherit the leagues' video copyright and may NOT be
#     redistributed, so they are gitignored and ship only in the closed university
#     submission. Keep these three OUT of the public repo.
outputs/detections_soccana_tvcalib.parquet
outputs/ball_positions.parquet
outputs/homographies_tvcalib.parquet
#
# Exploratory diagnostic scatters (regenerated on demand; not thesis artifacts).
outputs/figures/diagnostics/
# SoccerNet video media: rendered from league-copyrighted frames — not redistributable.
outputs/figures/annotated/
outputs/figures/overlay/
outputs/figures/*.mp4
outputs/figures/*.gif
outputs/figures/still_*.png